  "worked_solution": "The figure consists of $4$ rows, and each row has $5$ cubes.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14132963/assets/383abaac2e076b77b5649f73819fc77fc319266993d600397989686364e5ef9e.png)\n\nSo, there are $5\\times 4=20$ cubes in total.\n\nTherefore, the volume of the figure is $20$  cubic feet.",
